    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Get ready to enter a world of madness and mayhem in <strong>Attic Panic</strong>, a <strong>thrilling online party shooter with rogue-like elements</strong>. <br><br>In this <strong>top-down shooter</strong>, every round presents you with a wicked assortment of <strong>randomized upgrade cards</strong>, ensuring a heart-pounding experience that will keep you hooked. Whether you crave the thrill of shielding yourself from enemy fire, bouncing bullets off walls, or unleashing a storm of otherworldly destruction upon your foes, Attic Panic offers a playstyle for everyone!<br><br>Play as a possessed toy, controlled by the sinister Lovecraftian beast &quot;The Entity&quot;, and battle for supremacy in the dusty confines of a suburban attic. Armed with a devastating arsenal of weapons and abilities, you'll engage in intense shootouts, gathering upgrade cards and unlocking unique powers as you strive to become the most powerful follower of &quot;The Entity&quot;.<br><br>Summon <strong>up to three of your fearless friends</strong> and plunge headfirst into the abyss of madness today. With it's <strong>free-to-play</strong> model and addictive gameplay, Attic Panic stands as an indispensable addition to any collection of party games. So, heed the call and prove your worth to &quot;The Entity&quot; today. Join the battle, for the hour of reckoning is upon us!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168760/extras/5f1ab00d493c74328a1fac580f9e02c0.poster.avif?t=1688338761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168760/extras/5f1ab00d493c74328a1fac580f9e02c0.webm?t=1688338761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168760/extras/5f1ab00d493c74328a1fac580f9e02c0.mp4?t=1688338761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
